# Redeeming Rocks (crystalWar 4, call-only), the guards: a level 99 Warrior in Windurst Waters [S] (missions as the
# main flow). Available, RedeemingRocksProg 1 (a GM): Rohn answers his script's 440 (114 needs the accepted quest).
# Accepted (a GM), Prog 5, the bag full (a GM): Kocco 111 (110 is Prog 4 exactly), finished: no room: not completed.
# Prog 0, RedeemingDay far ahead of today (a GM): 111 again (any day but today), not completed. Completed (a GM), Prog
# 2: Kocco's script 140 (109 needs the accepted quest).
lists WindurstWatersS/Kocco_Ehllek/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/Rohn_Ehlbalna/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/111
char zone=WindurstWatersS pos=-41.973,-3.5,46.496 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
charvar RedeemingRocksProg 1            # a GM
trigger Rohn_Ehlbalna                   # available, Prog 1: his script's 440
finish
quest CrystalWar.RedeemingRocks accepted # a GM
charvar RedeemingRocksProg 5            # a GM
fill-inventory                          # a GM: no slot free
warp -39.965,-1.125,-163.018 WindurstWatersS
trigger Kocco_Ehllek                    # accepted, Prog 5, RedeemingDay 0: 111
finish                                  # no room for the earring: not completed
charvar RedeemingRocksProg 0            # a GM
charvar RedeemingDay 999999             # a GM: a day ahead of today
trigger Kocco_Ehllek                    # RedeemingDay is not today: 111
finish                                  # no room: not completed
free-inventory                          # a GM
quest CrystalWar.RedeemingRocks completed # a GM
charvar RedeemingRocksProg 2            # a GM
trigger Kocco_Ehllek                    # completed, Prog 2: his script's 140
finish
